# regenerable pipeline intermediates (data-architecture spec D2).
# Five of these no longer have a live writer — the tool that produced
# them was archived at `refs/tags/archive/v2-research-2026-09` in the
# 2026-09 pipeline consolidation, so they cannot be regenerated. Kept
# ignored anyway (a stale ignore is harmless; untracking them risks
# committing a leftover local copy):
#   - data/source/baseline-audit-report.json (baseline-audit tool)
#   - data/source/body-census-report.json (`body:census`, see
#     grammar.test.ts:53-58)
#   - data/source/body-migration-report.json (`migrate-dry.ts`)
#   - .usage-mark (`admin/pipeline/research/usage-report.ts --mark`)
#   - .work/ (the page-index build tool)
data/source/edit-replay.jsonl
data/source/baseline-audit-report.json
data/source/body-census-report.json
data/source/body-dryrun-report.json
data/source/body-migration-report.json
data/source/migration-report.json
.superpowers/
~$*.docx

